  "description": "I spent all my shining 20s paying off my debts. I barely paid it all back, and I got another new debt. On the bridge I went to say goodbye to the boring world. Yena, who ran into a man who wanted to make an extreme choice like herself. The two, who failed to commit suicide after a disturbance, We became very curious about each other's situation. \n\n\"Why did Yena try to die?\" \n\n\"I don't have money to pay back my debt.\" \n\n\"The debt, do I want you to pay me back?\" \n\nJoo-won's voice, a sunny man. The bell of the bell, and the dark life of Yena. Finally, did the days come when the Enterové of The Enterové of the Enterové?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60345457), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%A5%90%EA%B5%AC%EB%A9%8D-%EB%B3%95-%EB%93%A4-%EB%82%A0/3328)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/190959)",
